      "post_stream": {
        "posts": [
          {
            "id": 606021,
            "name": "Saksham Agarwal",
            "username": "consultsaksham",
            "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/consultsaksham/{size}/196630_2.png",
            "created_at": "2026-10-26T09:40:18.130Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m Saksham, an AI automation and technology advisor. I build AI agents on WhatsApp, web and email on my own production n8n stack, along with the integrations and architecture around them, and I handle scoping, delivery and support end to end.</p>\n<p>I’m looking for partners who already talk to business owners and can introduce me to the right ones: companies with a real operational problem (support overload, manual follow-ups, leads slipping through, data copied between tools) and a decision-maker open to a conversation.</p>\n<p>It’s a revenue share on every client you bring in, and we agree the details together. No retainers, no pay-per-lead, warm introductions only.</p>\n<p>If this fits how you work, reply here or message me with where your introductions would come from and the kinds of businesses you know.</p>\n<p>Saksham</p>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=15\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/t/jobs-category-guidelines-posting-and-applying/941\">here</a>.</small></p>",
